DebugItem: Debug Item
SetupFirstStatue.DisplayName: Setup first statue
ResetSeenBiomeFlag.DisplayName: Reset first seen biome flag
ResetCD.DisplayName: Reset CD

THXForPlaying: {
	DisplayName: Thanks for playing More Katana!
	Tooltip:
		'''
		The weapons in this mod have special abilities.
		[c/CC0000:{$Tooltips.PS}] - Activates when holding an item.
		[c/CC0000:{$Tooltips.AS}] - Activates when right-clicking.
		The cooldown is shared across all weapons.
		Detailed skill information for each weapon is provided in the tooltip.
		There's also some other content! (Still in development, maybe?) Check out the wiki too!
		You can use this item to open the wiki ;)
		'''
}

